msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96ac37af33c73feaaed7ad3539de56588538bf084abd894bc248bed9375fc6ac
#. default-sha256: 45d973bb2caabd6d34d501134f3bd5eb0a25e06356ebd0be03da17ae5e861b7b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did we get to this point?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come siamo arrivati a questo punto?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1e833147e234b0b733b56204dfa67987171034e3c0f2a1f6526f042179314ed
#. default-sha256: 396f350a35503bde547fc80f9fee6ec324d89c08a7d6fafdf4127dd4e25329e2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ugh... ⟪k:1⟫I hate everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ngh... ⟪k:1⟫Odio qualunque cosa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07a2805e0e66b29a2915f771c85446c2885e9850e8ad7447d3f1724b8211c0db
#. default-sha256: f20f0833597d4aa1c79f5171b6fae3ffd1e66b9551c7f4f0aefbfbdb51bc05fc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My spirits were getting darker and darker, like they were slowly sinking into a deep morass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il mio spirito si faceva sempre più cupo, come se stesse lentamente sprofondando in un "
"pantano."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5a8b64a98aab9fb4a302908198d855aec24e04099d5bcafe3181f8c426bc034
#. default-sha256: f65f85ed0578bddebb67bea6d859a95e03280819a387ede3d7a92d7bc7103cb5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been at the mansion for a month, ⟪k:1⟫and every day since felt twice as long as it "
"should have."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero in quella villa da un mese, ⟪k:1⟫e ogni giorno sembrava durare il doppio del dovuto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e75a7c4a60bcf7a8ee130a00a1aa0e494b47df7ef9594a46766cb018f4bfe16b
#. default-sha256: 2eebbac71330a1708fee0f8f689e63347cb96049784f6ffc67823ce121794c9e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been optimistic, at first. ⟪k:1⟫I’d even had a little hope that me and Michel could "
"get along together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero stata ottimista, all’inizio. ⟪k:1⟫Avevo anche nutrito la speranza che io e Michel "
"saremmo potuti andare d’accordo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f0eff0b7ff003294442413babbe487123ad0a3a6219a14dbd78fcb205374295
#. default-sha256: df2b11d44b1bb2b8d3e53ca850491c8430722fa7a2491b4d9d075e0b440e7778
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it hadn’t taken long for that hope to be shattered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non ci volle molto perché quella speranza andasse in frantumi,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d552b96e914721296f63d4d163576782eafff539eaac6dcfc416c89cae84a8e
#. default-sha256: 631a3a41ac78b0851c83f65e2aa8c59660d59870790860cb3c8a3f392cc965c7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the cheer locked away inside me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫segregando la mia allegria dentro di me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f18e2737d4c4f3f0d6b7b6577c3f802fcd44a23b1801487a21cfc4f9e9d630d7
#. default-sha256: 1c469d83aef8ea6e04cfbcb4bd50a3998c95c328b72d501d1fb235751f2e519f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We lived in the same house, but we never spoke anymore. ⟪k:1⟫On the few occasions we ⟪k:2⟫"
"did⟪k:3⟫ cross paths, he just gave me a cold glare and nothing more,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vivevamo nella stessa casa, ma non parlavamo più.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nelle poche occasioni in cui le "
"nostre strade si incrociavano,⟪k:3⟫mi lanciava gelide occhiate, e nient’altro;"

#: scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7e0fbef2c2e7c0fc2ef6a943418eeb77127865b24188031d639c8b26cb07fe1
#. default-sha256: cc31d0da843d19b475cc277819b16a0d3e0d38932bb19c9cee09d8c658dfa03a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫scorn and suspicion in his eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫c’erano solo disprezzo e diffidenza nei suoi occhi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf6ece0b4d318cd6396533b8146d7942bf8e36957c07e32ef8251bfb531ea0f9
#. default-sha256: b7abdf27fc84b5ea12689b22f78f7a9395b24a1b181388ee2766774bee16093d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whenever he looked at me like that, it felt as though my throat was being constricted—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫like I was deep underwater and running out of air."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta che mi guardava in quel modo, mi sembrava come se la mia gola venisse stretta—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫come se stessi annegando e fossi a corto d’aria."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36dee5a55024cca89e030bbb87ddfcd7d2eab094df0e69bc32f6c5f4ff9118a4
#. default-sha256: 991917e9c87c20cb13048badf53c1b73564707e576f8acbffc3b2a8643733bc1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like my very presence in the world was a crime."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come se la mia stessa esistenza fosse un crimine."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4eacff1dad208c22c949b1452020e9c924a3cf22a4a3943265ebab47bd80400
#. default-sha256: 1f446e272f640268cd3f202fd294e1addf972dd9d3344a918e029e4c9e08ac88
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I never could have imagined just how agonizing constant rejection was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non avrei mai potuto immaginare quanto fosse straziante il costante rifiuto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbc7c72a924d14b567b9252d7f43b33a257206c2db6143cab581fd858f52b476
#. default-sha256: 00e19017a5848dd62b3447ce112e3e88d7e0fe408a31e788f920f5f55c6f4c7f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I started despising others. ⟪k:1⟫Despising myself. ⟪k:2⟫Despising the world. ⟪k:3⟫Convinced "
"there was no one who could set me free."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cominciai a disprezzare gli altri. ⟪k:1⟫A disprezzare me stessa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫A disprezzare il "
"mondo. ⟪k:4⟫Convinta che non ci fosse nessuno⟪k:5⟫che potesse liberarmi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a229204bff73cf1678369c05efd98045251ff7be7ea38ce8e5bff7c1fec87a6
#. default-sha256: 82ca54425cda21dcee4cdc17a77c7b16f3d69e165884be3a2c1a680650e43f72
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I considered running away from everything,⟪k:1⟫rather than live like this another day,⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫but I would have done so long ago⟪k:4⟫if that were actually an option."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo considerato di scappare da tutto,⟪k:1⟫piuttosto che vivere un altro giorno in quel "
"modo,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ma l’avrei fatto molto prima se solo fosse stata un’opzione."

#: scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7539a173ba6d3ec40d1e8f20d5505fccf2f56cf513478d066b80552de89dd45
#. default-sha256: bbaf46c1870a73e6a9947755ea84fc67aa91f585325fb7bd3d1e1c1e9b469572
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If they found out I had fled—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that I had acted outside their wishes—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫my mom and sister would pay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se avessero scoperto che ero scappata—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che avevo agito contro il loro volere—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫mia madre e mia sorella avrebbero pagato."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e359b0802bd8dad222579f49f8ca2d463123eddc8c862924adaa1b2e7ef602a
#. default-sha256: 19546c560e6c6718f29935d4c40c33ac7dad0ea10c8e84a795fb66eee9abd7ef
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had succeeded in allowing my sister to get married and my mom to live comfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero riuscita a permettere a mia sorella di sposarsi,⟪k:1⟫e a mia madre di vivere agiatamente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e3a0f0d60480068256e856415282fffa2ef59f04c499f5610c9003c81281e4
#. default-sha256: 2e6f95fa2627dc1c8057edfa2b380b13db36166180140016d8d6613780a969a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had given them happiness. ⟪k:1⟫I couldn’t take that away from them again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avevo dato loro la felicità. ⟪k:1⟫Non potevo sottrargliela di nuovo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cee5f711883142083f77253d3ac44ff63e36368e673d2d2ccf0c290562040c03
#. default-sha256: 2ce8db77831de84766c3da2c1525acd100f3cda8fca7689481a3e3b229e353d2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not after what I had to go through to do it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non dopo tutto quello che avevo dovuto passare per arrivarci..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2089828b4c8ff281d452927b226285d26034541f5b8b555ba8f1c163977eef7
#. default-sha256: 045da2411f50930ab0520caeaffdebeb982cf67e47cb306e0dfd81d3decc05ae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, no, cut that out. ⟪k:1⟫Getting way too depressing, Giselle.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, no, dacci un taglio. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ fin troppo deprimente, Giselle.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0e3b7b89d5054ffc46d9e45f4cc65dcf5ab2939070f6b9b030b45793d2bba04
#. default-sha256: 770c7263ebeed42bcad475598d248ae3788ecddb46ed57f4abc74b3249253deb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Pull yourself together! That’s not who you are!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Riprenditi! Questa non sei tu!)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 844afd16daa0747eb3f98a8784b4cdf93ceabe74134740afce92ff2fe5b341e0
#. default-sha256: e756406d9067bf8d22ae9ba3f94eb16d97cc7e4ff42e850e92bdc864af694795
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Be positive...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Sii positiva...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7d50b88dc54b8aaf212ade5d91327a8ac09e2251e9e2e3ea3dad08594be839a
#. default-sha256: 873cf9997264a0069f1fe7331a2de28571c8346dca34834d42e0424bd58172af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The negativity didn’t only come from my interactions with Michel, either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La negatività non derivava solo dalle mie interazioni con Michel, comunque."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30860d86e197e34263214ea699e5403bc99994b80d8aebf802dcf6f6d7803122
#. default-sha256: 29298b9aca954c09d850c65f265ddcaca4383a486c74988973299757a233cc4b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, there seemed to be some kind of terrible presence within the mansion that twisted "
"people’s hearts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, sembrava esserci una specie di terribile presenza all’interno della villa che distorceva "
"i cuori delle persone."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f49ec55b1339505a8dee9ac7218c825ce6f8c0413cd28ab56eb2a53b5e3f9557
#. default-sha256: 4efcef3f28700c9893488011412f6ffa7fb841dedeea89484c1216f5e7e193aa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion was, in fact, a bit of a local legend, which I had been informed about before "
"being sent here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La villa era, infatti, protagonista di una leggenda locale,⟪k:1⟫di cui ero stata informata "
"prima di essere mandata lì."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 245b418cfdfad899f858cc93fb9fcf81132f89b78b7554177df459c5e280b949
#. default-sha256: 5e3667055131d8778d4316477db91c022aa6b685c12b9a2c6e8a9e39a98681ba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People claimed it was cursed, and that an evil witch had lived in it for many, many years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La gente sosteneva che fosse maledetta, e che una strega malvagia⟪k:1⟫vi avesse dimorato per "
"molti, molti anni."

#: scenario5:scenario5_75C08C9A_09D8_48D0_84FB_2B452D642BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b75a551298c044ada2b7a4ac4a83d66973ce2d2b78bb04ff2792df07937beeab
#. default-sha256: 39ea29abeb95d67e025171a995c326cbd04470296b48c7437a1fc59733bcceb4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C08C9A_09D8_48D0_84FB_2B452D642BFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel joked that he was the witch, but I didn’t believe him."
msgstr ""
